                                "sense_id": "9e9c448f-fa23-3649-8264-d2f0a40a1650",
                                "text": "[O]n the flat coastal swamps of South Florida, where the palmettos once blew over the detritus of a dozen failed booms and the hotels were boarded up six months a year, there has evolved […] a settlement of considerable interest […]."
                            }
